{"id": 43793337, "slug": "cultural-dissonance", "title": "Cultural Dissonance", "subtitle": "November 26th, 2019", "post_date": "2021-11-09T19:44:25.127Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 182, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p>What if the issue with the #tradeWar was a disagreement about <strong>culture </strong>and not <strong>economics</strong>?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png\" width=\"475\" height=\"193\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:193,&quot;width&quot;:475,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;china.summons.20191126.PNG&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"china.summons.20191126.PNG\" title=\"china.summons.20191126.PNG\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!83a5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F906698dd-b9b7-40b4-a3d1-b59fef027189_475x193.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>Seems like at the moment, democracy is working on two channels, to undermine the party.</p><p>The first in the democracy #overthere, voting out Beijing in favor of Democracy.</p><div class=\"c